{"id":"4cf7beb80b8cbfd7","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-comb5-stationary-set.md","title":"ZFC Comb5 Stationary Set","display":"df-zfc-comb5-stationary-set — ZFC Comb5 Stationary Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb5-stationary-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb5-stationary-set"],"display":"df-zfc-comb5-stationary-set — ZFC Comb5 Stationary Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb5-stationary-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-stationary-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb5-stationary-set — ZFC Comb5 Stationary Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S \\in V\">\\(\\kappa,S \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5StationarySet}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5StationarySet}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5StationarySet}_S(\\kappa,S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5StationarySet}_S(\\kappa,S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a namespace alias for <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>, whose definition already includes regularity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and intersection with every club subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The former local expansion incorrectly expressed club closure by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\subseteq C\">\\(\\lambda\\subseteq C\\)</span>; closure is instead a limit-point condition on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\cap\\lambda\">\\(C\\cap\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","loc